# rmmc_help (2026-11-26): the Help tab says what each key does. Each help row names a key letter; keybinds.pdl owns the key code. A pair of rows here ties the two (b=98 g=103 m=109 space=32 0=48 Home=65360 p=112 o=111 ]=93 u=117), so changing a key without its help line (or the reverse) fails. Controls: a wrong code and a swapped line must NOT be found.
